  "data": {
    "id": 1,
    "title": "Introduction",
    "text": "<p><strong>STAGECREW</strong>&rsquo;s primary goal is to create lasting work via a creative process that promotes curiosity, conversation and open-mindedness, and by fostering an infectious, collaborative energy; one which brings together different skills, perspectives, and personalities to reach a common goal with enthusiasm and respect. We seek to make great things with great people, all around the globe.</p>",
    "title2": "Pitch",
    "text2": null,
    "title3": "The Mark",
    "text3": "<p><strong>OUR MARK</strong> represents the backstage of a theatre; a magical space that runs behind and adjacent to the stage, where the team move unseen to produce the show. We love what this represents; an all-hands on deck, energetic coming together of people to create something uniquely human.</p>",
    "info_lists": [
      {
        "list": "Creative Direction\nStrategy\nStorytelling\nVisual Identity\nPhotography + Film\nDigital",
        "title": "Areas of\nExpertise"
      },
      {
        "list": "Culture\nSustainability\nFashion\nArts\nHospitality\nFood & Drink\nProduct",
        "title": "Operating\nSectors"
      },
      {
        "list": "Collaboration\nRespect\nIntention\nEnjoyment\nCuriosity",
        "title": "Core\nPrinciples"
      }
    ],
    "text4": "<p><strong>WE </strong>support our core in-house team with an extended network of supremely talented friends and collaborators, who help us shape our projects with technical skill, fresh perspectives, and new ideas. We embrace a more personal, ongoing one-to-one relationship with our partners; one that yields meaningful and distinct work though enjoyment and experimentation over arbitrary deadlines and deliverables. We firmly reject the use of generative AI in favour of authentic human creativity.</p>",
